WEBVTT

01:37.600 --> 01:39.920
EPISODE 27

01:49.080 --> 01:50.680
- My lord.
- I've waited a long time.

01:51.440 --> 01:53.320
I haven't told you yet.

01:53.400 --> 01:54.800
I won't go to the office today.

01:54.880 --> 01:56.840
I gave the medicine to Qingshi.

01:56.920 --> 01:59.320
Just heat it up before you take it.

02:02.800 --> 02:05.280
Yes, my lord. It arrived before dawn.

02:05.360 --> 02:07.080
You left in a rush. I couldn't inform you.

02:08.520 --> 02:11.080
Are you heading to the office?
I'll see you out.

02:18.480 --> 02:19.800
Going out today?

02:21.440 --> 02:22.680
When I returned yesterday,

02:22.760 --> 02:25.800
Granny mentioned arranging a match
for your cousin Fang Yuchan.

02:25.880 --> 02:29.960
You don't need to oversee it yourself.
The matchmaker can handle it, right?

02:33.280 --> 02:35.400
She should make her own choice.

02:36.000 --> 02:38.000
But she's alone in the capital.

02:38.080 --> 02:39.960
She has no elders to guide her.

02:40.040 --> 02:42.920
Granny asked Aunt to assist,

02:43.000 --> 02:45.880
but it's hard for young women

02:46.480 --> 02:48.280
to speak freely.

02:49.080 --> 02:50.320
Granny asked me

02:50.400 --> 02:53.800
to help with advice.

02:53.880 --> 02:54.920
Can't risk her future.

02:56.240 --> 02:58.560
Two matches today, three tomorrow.

02:58.640 --> 03:00.400
Granny said

03:00.480 --> 03:03.960
we must find a perfect match for her.

03:05.680 --> 03:08.520
Then, do your business.
No need to see me out.

03:09.640 --> 03:10.680
Take care.

03:21.280 --> 03:23.560
- Shall we go?
- Sure.

04:00.360 --> 04:01.680
Enough.

04:02.560 --> 04:04.280
Seven days of meetings nonstop.

04:04.360 --> 04:06.640
Three or four suitors daily.

04:06.720 --> 04:09.600
Talented and rich. You fancy no one.

04:09.680 --> 04:11.480
What are you looking for exactly?

04:11.560 --> 04:12.640
Just tell us

04:12.720 --> 04:13.800
to save our time.

04:15.200 --> 04:17.800
Aunt, these things can't be rushed.

04:20.080 --> 04:21.080
Cousin…

04:23.680 --> 04:26.240
your aunt even introduced past candidates

04:26.320 --> 04:29.160
for Guiniang.

04:29.240 --> 04:30.240
They're from noble,

04:30.320 --> 04:32.600
educated families.

04:32.680 --> 04:36.440
If you have other thoughts,
tell me privately.

04:45.760 --> 04:48.640
Your choices are excellent.

04:48.720 --> 04:53.120
But appearance matters too.

04:53.200 --> 04:55.400
That aspect should be considered.

04:59.840 --> 05:04.120
You heard her. She wants a handsome match.

05:04.200 --> 05:05.080
Of course, we have.

05:05.160 --> 05:07.440
There's one. The wealthy Lu family
from the west.

05:07.520 --> 05:10.720
They own over 20 cargo ships,
a rich household.

05:10.800 --> 05:12.880
Their ninth son, Lu Sheng,

05:12.960 --> 05:14.800
is dashing and refined.

05:14.880 --> 05:17.400
A true gem, cultured and charming,
a rare find.

05:17.480 --> 05:19.600
He's been picky

05:19.680 --> 05:23.360
and hard to match.
They take a lot of time and energy.

05:23.440 --> 05:25.520
Isn't this fate?

05:26.120 --> 05:29.640
But he's studying at the academy.
It's too soon to meet him.

05:30.440 --> 05:33.680
His twin brother looks just like him.

05:33.760 --> 05:36.480
You can barely tell them apart.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.080
Why not meet the brother instead?

05:39.160 --> 05:41.000
That might not be appropriate.

05:41.080 --> 05:43.920
Let's wait until Lu Sheng returns.

05:44.000 --> 05:47.080
I've heard good things

05:47.880 --> 05:50.240
about the Lu brothers.

05:50.840 --> 05:55.160
Meeting the twin is fine too.
They're both great.

05:55.240 --> 05:57.880
Of course. I'll bring him over.
Please wait.

06:08.280 --> 06:11.680
It's already late, but she's still out?

06:11.760 --> 06:13.000
Yes.

06:13.640 --> 06:16.160
When she returns,
have her come to the study immediately.

06:16.920 --> 06:18.040
Yes.

06:18.760 --> 06:20.680
Qingshi, what's wrong with the lord?

06:20.760 --> 06:22.440
He looks so pale.

06:22.520 --> 06:23.840
Xi'er,

06:23.920 --> 06:26.360
no millstone turns without a pivot.

06:26.440 --> 06:29.040
Tell your lady to think carefully.

06:32.320 --> 06:35.400
The one with the yellow flower,
that's him.

06:36.480 --> 06:39.920
There are so many with flowers.
Which one is him?

06:40.000 --> 06:41.760
The one with the yellow flower,

06:41.840 --> 06:44.440
tall and fair-skinned.

06:45.160 --> 06:47.360
Take another look.

06:59.880 --> 07:01.560
What does this mean?

07:01.640 --> 07:02.720
Why is she leaving?

07:02.800 --> 07:05.360
Aunt, I think she's decided.

07:06.640 --> 07:08.040
Please inform the Lu family.

07:08.120 --> 07:12.040
If he is unmarried, let's proceed.

07:12.640 --> 07:15.200
I'll do my best, my lady.

07:18.640 --> 07:21.560
SHEN'S MANSION

07:33.440 --> 07:34.280
Greetings, my lord.

07:35.040 --> 07:37.760
Did you have a good day, my lady?

07:38.920 --> 07:41.560
Thank you for asking. Everything is fine.

07:43.280 --> 07:44.680
What have you been busy with?

07:45.800 --> 07:48.040
I was about to report to you.

07:48.560 --> 07:52.840
Fang chose the Lu family's tenth son.

07:52.920 --> 07:56.240
But his elder brother, the ninth son,
insists that he should marry first.

07:56.840 --> 08:00.560
Good thing is, the ninth son, Lu Sheng,
is a student at Bailu Academy.

08:00.640 --> 08:02.560
He's handsome, poetic,

08:02.640 --> 08:04.760
and even artistic.

08:04.840 --> 08:08.440
A rare gem, perfect for Fang.

08:08.520 --> 08:12.280
Aunt wants to verify his character.

08:12.360 --> 08:14.560
He's truly worthy

08:14.640 --> 08:15.960
of his reputation.

08:16.040 --> 08:18.280
So, this match was done.

08:19.480 --> 08:22.560
Handsome? You saw him?

08:25.480 --> 08:29.800
I only saw him briefly across the street.

08:30.800 --> 08:32.360
But if Fang approves,

08:32.440 --> 08:35.760
his brother should be similar.

08:36.480 --> 08:37.800
So,

08:38.320 --> 08:41.200
you've completed your task?

08:41.280 --> 08:44.680
Making a match isn't that simple.

08:44.760 --> 08:46.240
The dowry is another big task.

08:46.840 --> 08:50.080
Once the engagement is confirmed,
gifts must be exchanged.

08:50.160 --> 08:51.920
The formal ceremony

08:52.000 --> 08:53.960
requires careful preparation.

08:54.040 --> 08:55.760
Not a single mistake can be made.

08:56.520 --> 08:59.840
The Old Lady assigned me to handle it.

08:59.920 --> 09:02.400
I'm nervous about doing it right.

09:02.480 --> 09:04.560
Do you think I can do it?

09:05.480 --> 09:07.600
If you can handle crime cases,

09:07.680 --> 09:11.040
you can, of course, plan a wedding.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.840
If you say so,

09:13.920 --> 09:15.640
I'd believe that.

09:15.720 --> 09:16.920
Then, I'll do my best.

09:17.640 --> 09:19.200
Helping with this wedding

09:19.280 --> 09:21.640
can make up

09:21.720 --> 09:23.360
for what I did to her.

09:23.960 --> 09:26.360
I need to report this to the Old Lady.

09:26.440 --> 09:29.800
If there's anything else,
I'll take my leave now.

09:34.760 --> 09:36.320
Anything else, my lord?

09:39.400 --> 09:40.480
You may go.

10:10.440 --> 10:14.080
Family Fan's cloth shop
is the best in Bianjing.

10:14.160 --> 10:16.720
Not just the silks
from Qingzhou and Qizhou…

10:17.320 --> 10:18.560
My lord.

10:21.200 --> 10:22.040
Where are you going?

10:23.160 --> 10:25.760
I'm taking her to choose wedding fabrics.

10:27.440 --> 10:30.840
I'm grateful for sister-in-law's help.

10:30.920 --> 10:33.200
Thank you, cousin.

10:34.000 --> 10:36.520
We are relatives. No need for thanks.

10:37.440 --> 10:38.520
Go ahead.

10:53.560 --> 10:56.200
The lady's been so busy
with wedding plans.

10:59.360 --> 11:01.360
My lord, I've inquired about it.

11:01.440 --> 11:05.080
The wedding is set for June 18th.
No matter how busy, it'll all end in June.

11:09.880 --> 11:13.440
Husband and wife grow close, then distant.

11:13.520 --> 11:18.080
She keeps her word
to treat each other with respect.

11:25.800 --> 11:26.920
It's time!

11:27.520 --> 11:29.080
Lift the sedan.

11:29.160 --> 11:34.720
SHEN'S MANSION

11:52.880 --> 11:54.560
It should be all joyful. You made it.

11:55.520 --> 11:57.760
Yet you feel sad.

11:58.280 --> 12:01.720
She has the groom greeting her
in this life moment.

12:01.800 --> 12:04.480
But I came with a smile on my face
and left with tears. Tragic for me.

12:04.560 --> 12:06.000
I will, of course, feel sad.

12:06.520 --> 12:07.920
You're right.

12:08.840 --> 12:11.720
Granny isn't well and stayed away.

12:11.800 --> 12:14.840
She's likely upset. I'll go comfort her.

12:14.920 --> 12:16.320
Would you like to join me?

12:20.080 --> 12:21.240
It's fine. Just go.

12:22.120 --> 12:23.040
Sure.

12:29.240 --> 12:30.760
Qingshi, Qingshi.

12:32.320 --> 12:33.800
- I'm here.
- Send invitations

12:33.880 --> 12:36.680
to my elder brothers-in-law
to Pan Restaurant.

12:36.760 --> 12:39.840
My lord, you meet Mr. Du daily at court.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.640
What if he asks why?

12:41.720 --> 12:42.800
Tell him I want some advice.

12:43.400 --> 12:44.680
Yes.

13:14.440 --> 13:16.440
Everything feels dull.

13:16.960 --> 13:19.400
I'd rather join Brother at his desk.

13:21.120 --> 13:24.200
Sweet talks first

13:24.800 --> 13:27.320
and then take control by punishments.

13:27.400 --> 13:31.240
You need to punish him hard
for him to learn the lessons.

13:31.320 --> 13:33.520
Until he regrets his missteps,

13:33.600 --> 13:35.600
I must hold myself.

13:35.680 --> 13:38.080
I have no choice but to endure.

13:38.920 --> 13:40.080
My lady.

13:41.480 --> 13:43.000
Lord is waiting for you in the garden.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.640
Let's go.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.960
PEACEFUL VIBES

14:22.600 --> 14:25.120
Orchids are the most popular this season.

14:25.800 --> 14:27.360
Vendors sell them in the early mornings.

14:27.440 --> 14:30.160
All sold out by dawn.

14:30.240 --> 14:32.480
How did you know I love orchids?

14:34.360 --> 14:36.960
I also know you like wearing flowers.

14:37.040 --> 14:39.080
Always adorned with fragrant blooms.

14:43.480 --> 14:47.120
The scent in this pavilion, what is it?

14:48.000 --> 14:50.360
Didn't Sifu House
sell incense cakes and powders?

14:51.560 --> 14:52.440
You can't tell?

14:57.080 --> 15:00.400
With orchids and jasmine in this garden,

15:00.480 --> 15:02.360
it's hard to pinpoint the fragrance.

15:02.440 --> 15:04.760
Last year at the palace banquet,

15:04.840 --> 15:08.200
His Majesty gifted ambergris incense
to us all.

15:08.280 --> 15:11.800
It smelled too musky.
So, I kept mine in storage.

15:11.880 --> 15:15.120
I heard you love incense,
so I had it retrieved.

15:16.240 --> 15:17.080
Is that so?

15:25.320 --> 15:26.720
I know you dislike the heat.

15:26.800 --> 15:30.120
I stopped by a shop for cooling drinks.

15:30.720 --> 15:32.320
Fresh treats

15:32.400 --> 15:34.480
sent from the estate today.

15:35.640 --> 15:36.760
Try some.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.240
This plum blossom wine

15:47.320 --> 15:49.280
is from Liang's shop.

15:49.360 --> 15:52.800
The blossoms were picked in early winter.
Preserved in honey jars with salt.

15:52.880 --> 15:54.840
Wait until June for it to brew.

15:55.680 --> 15:57.280
We sell it too,

15:57.800 --> 16:00.320
but it's less fragrant.

16:00.400 --> 16:01.480
I used to sneak out

16:01.560 --> 16:03.920
with Leshan to buy it.

16:08.800 --> 16:10.400
That's not a stop-by.

16:10.480 --> 16:12.800
You bought it just for me?

16:16.640 --> 16:19.320
Haode, I just

16:20.520 --> 16:21.880
wanted to make you happy.

16:26.280 --> 16:28.760
Happy? I'm very happy.

16:33.560 --> 16:35.440
You don't need to trouble yourself for me.

16:36.120 --> 16:38.840
I lack nothing in this house.

16:39.880 --> 16:43.480
Though it's hot,
too much cold drink isn't good

16:44.080 --> 16:45.400
for the health.

16:51.920 --> 16:54.680
My lord, bees! Bees!

16:54.760 --> 16:56.840
Qingshi! Qingshi!

16:57.360 --> 16:58.800
- Remove the flowers.
- My lord.

16:59.520 --> 17:01.160
- Don't sting me.
- Hurry.

17:01.240 --> 17:02.480
- Come here.
- Don't sting me.

17:02.560 --> 17:04.320
- Hurry! Move them all!
- Hurry up!

17:04.400 --> 17:05.520
- Quick!
- Huizhao.

17:05.600 --> 17:07.720
- Move them all.
- Hurry up.

17:07.800 --> 17:09.040
Come here.

17:15.080 --> 17:16.840
Haode, it's okay.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.440
Brother.

17:18.520 --> 17:21.760
There are flowers everywhere,
yet you still burn incense.

17:21.840 --> 17:24.480
Are you upset I've been distant lately?

17:24.560 --> 17:25.960
Is this to tease me?

17:26.040 --> 17:27.440
Of course not.

17:27.520 --> 17:29.160
Your brothers-in-law suggested this…

17:30.840 --> 17:31.840
My brothers-in-law?

17:35.440 --> 17:37.840
I wasn't sure what you liked.

17:38.920 --> 17:40.680
So, I asked them for advice.

17:40.760 --> 17:45.560
They said you love flowers,
fragrance, and elegance.

17:45.640 --> 17:47.160
That's why I tried to please you.

17:47.760 --> 17:49.440
I'm sorry.

17:50.280 --> 17:51.760
Does it hurt? Let me see.

17:57.760 --> 17:59.120
Wife's favors,

17:59.200 --> 18:01.800
you can know from daily life.
Why ask others?

18:02.600 --> 18:05.280
I fear I've been too attentive before.

18:05.360 --> 18:07.120
Now you've seen me change my way,

18:07.200 --> 18:08.600
you feel bad

18:09.480 --> 18:11.280
and make insincere flattery.

18:11.840 --> 18:13.680
People value what's hard to obtain.

18:14.280 --> 18:17.520
Once they have it, it feels less special.

18:17.600 --> 18:19.520
If I give you my heart,

18:19.600 --> 18:22.280
will you change and leave me behind again?

18:23.200 --> 18:26.840
Couples can live without deep love,

18:26.920 --> 18:29.120
as long as there's respect.

18:29.200 --> 18:31.720
But if you constantly fool me

18:31.800 --> 18:33.400
with disrespect,

18:33.480 --> 18:35.640
our marriage will end soon.

18:42.560 --> 18:43.640
Haode.

18:47.320 --> 18:48.600
Haode.

18:50.400 --> 18:51.920
OFFICIAL RANKING LIST

19:04.240 --> 19:05.520
Aren't you still upset?

19:06.040 --> 19:07.360
Why come here?

19:08.760 --> 19:11.320
Just speaking my mind. Who said I'm upset?

19:11.400 --> 19:13.200
I'm not that petty.

19:13.280 --> 19:15.240
A few days out of the study,
and it's a mess.

19:15.320 --> 19:17.400
Qingshi deserves punishment.

19:18.400 --> 19:20.240
I told him not to clean up.

19:20.760 --> 19:22.880
If it's neat, you'd never come back.

19:31.040 --> 19:32.560
Haode.

19:33.080 --> 19:36.200
You've done so much for me,
I want to do something for you too.

19:37.360 --> 19:38.760
But for so many years,

19:39.560 --> 19:41.200
I've never tried to impress a woman.

19:41.960 --> 19:44.160
I don't know how to do it.

19:44.760 --> 19:47.560
Could you forgive me for being rusty?

19:50.400 --> 19:51.760
I'd never blame you.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.320
I painted it for you.

20:00.920 --> 20:04.000
But they said you prefer flowers
and incense.

20:04.080 --> 20:08.360
If you like jeweled hairpins, I can…

20:14.680 --> 20:17.640
Did I mess up again?

20:18.760 --> 20:21.120
Forget it. The painting isn't good.

20:24.520 --> 20:27.400
My sisters told me
to be reserved and strategic.

20:27.480 --> 20:30.120
But I'm not them. I can't do that.

20:31.160 --> 20:32.920
What I treasure

20:33.000 --> 20:36.600
isn't flowers or jewels.

20:38.400 --> 20:39.640
It's a person.

20:47.120 --> 20:50.040
I love his honesty and integrity.

20:50.120 --> 20:53.520
I admire his devotion to justice

20:53.600 --> 20:54.760
and truth.

20:55.800 --> 20:57.560
I love his straightforwardness

20:58.240 --> 21:00.440
and his rusty behavior.

21:01.240 --> 21:03.680
I don't need him to learn from others.

21:03.760 --> 21:06.320
I don't need playful moments with him.

21:06.400 --> 21:08.160
I just want

21:09.040 --> 21:10.520
a promise from him.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.560
Haode.

21:13.560 --> 21:16.040
I'll never let you go,

21:16.680 --> 21:20.120
never lie to you, never hide from you,
never hurt you again.

21:21.000 --> 21:22.760
You're the mistress of the Shen family

21:23.560 --> 21:24.720
and my only wife.

21:26.320 --> 21:27.680
So, Brother,

21:28.480 --> 21:30.040
did you find a solution to your worries?

21:30.640 --> 21:34.200
I've figured out these days,

21:35.040 --> 21:37.280
I don't want you mistreated by others.

21:37.800 --> 21:41.120
I don't want you suffering
somewhere I can't see.

21:41.200 --> 21:43.960
Nor do I want you here

21:44.480 --> 21:46.000
but keeping distance.

21:46.920 --> 21:49.320
This makes me feel uncertain
and out of reach.

21:49.400 --> 21:51.800
Compared to the old traumas,

21:52.320 --> 21:54.000
I am now afraid more

21:55.520 --> 21:56.720
of losing you.

21:57.320 --> 21:58.800
Promise me,

21:58.880 --> 22:00.640
if you lie to me again,

22:00.720 --> 22:03.240
- I'll--
- Never forgive me, never come back.

22:03.320 --> 22:04.560
Never look back again.

22:08.800 --> 22:10.760
I barely got a good look at it.

22:14.320 --> 22:16.960
Haode, you're so unpredictable.

22:17.680 --> 22:19.920
Among my sisters,
I'm the easiest to please.

22:21.000 --> 22:23.320
I haven't even used

22:23.400 --> 22:24.800
half my tricks yet.

22:25.520 --> 22:28.480
Then I should

22:28.560 --> 22:29.880
pity my brothers-in-law.

22:30.960 --> 22:33.920
- What did you say?
- I said…

22:34.000 --> 22:36.920
This painting looks like you
but doesn't get your spirit.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.800
It can't compare to the real you at all.

22:39.320 --> 22:41.440
I'll paint another for you someday.

23:17.760 --> 23:19.200
It's nothing. I'll go check on it.

23:34.800 --> 23:35.960
My lord.

23:37.560 --> 23:39.320
I can't handle it.

23:47.440 --> 23:48.280
Haode.

23:49.280 --> 23:52.280
Didn't you say no one would disturb us?

23:52.360 --> 23:54.000
Are you deceiving me again?

23:54.080 --> 23:57.440
There's a murder at the Lu house.
Fang is accused.

23:59.040 --> 24:00.440
What?

24:01.120 --> 24:03.600
My lord, there was no fraudulent marriage.

24:04.200 --> 24:07.240
It was my tenth son who went to meet her.

24:07.320 --> 24:09.040
When the matchmaker proposed,

24:09.120 --> 24:10.880
we didn't want to mess up
the family order.

24:10.960 --> 24:12.640
So, we arranged for my ninth son.

24:13.240 --> 24:15.680
After setting the marriage date,
we wrote to him

24:15.760 --> 24:17.800
to return for the wedding.

24:17.880 --> 24:19.960
But he took a shortcut to be on time.

24:20.040 --> 24:24.000
Robbers attacked him,

24:24.080 --> 24:25.600
leaving him scarred.

24:25.680 --> 24:27.560
At the time of the betrothal,

24:27.640 --> 24:29.160
he was handsome and talented.

24:29.240 --> 24:32.320
This accident can't be called deception.

24:32.400 --> 24:34.400
Moreover, once a marriage is promised,

24:34.480 --> 24:37.720
wealth, status, or beauty
shouldn't matter.

24:37.800 --> 24:40.040
That vicious woman

24:40.120 --> 24:42.880
despised his appearance.
She schemed to murder him.

24:43.480 --> 24:45.840
If he was injured on the way,

24:45.920 --> 24:47.600
why didn't you explain before the wedding?

24:47.680 --> 24:49.960
And who exactly came for the bride?

24:50.040 --> 24:52.640
My lord,
it wasn't intentional concealment.

24:52.720 --> 24:55.160
The wedding date was fixed,

24:55.240 --> 24:56.840
invitations sent.

24:56.920 --> 25:00.880
A delay would've brought bad luck.

25:00.960 --> 25:03.640
Who would do that?

25:04.240 --> 25:08.200
We hoped the bride would join early
and dispel the misfortune.

25:08.280 --> 25:10.680
My son couldn't show his injured face.

25:10.760 --> 25:14.840
Luckily, they look alike, and people
can't tell the difference between them.

25:14.920 --> 25:17.520
So, his brother acted as the groom.

25:17.600 --> 25:20.680
That's not against the law, is it?

25:21.720 --> 25:24.120
Still trying to cover it up?

25:24.200 --> 25:27.040
Even if it wasn't fraud, it was deceit.

25:27.880 --> 25:29.880
Before marriage, you should've explained,

25:29.960 --> 25:32.760
waited for him to recover,

25:32.840 --> 25:35.880
or annulled it. Both are okay.

25:36.480 --> 25:40.360
Hiding the truth
forced the bride to comply.

25:42.400 --> 25:45.120
My lord,
we admit the fault for concealing this.

25:45.200 --> 25:46.880
Punish us however you see fit.

25:46.960 --> 25:51.000
But Fang's attempted murder is heinous.

25:51.080 --> 25:54.720
She deserves the death penalty.
Please judge fairly, my lord.

26:11.120 --> 26:15.160
Haode, you're finally here!

26:15.680 --> 26:17.360
- Don't cry yet.
- Haode.

26:17.440 --> 26:20.200
Tell me. What happened exactly?

26:20.280 --> 26:21.680
Sit here.

26:26.760 --> 26:27.600
Haode.

26:28.200 --> 26:30.120
On my wedding night,

26:30.200 --> 26:31.840
the front hall feast went on forever.

26:31.920 --> 26:34.360
The servants in the room were sent away.

26:34.440 --> 26:36.160
I got tired waiting

26:36.680 --> 26:38.760
and dozed off.

26:39.440 --> 26:42.880
In the middle of the night, I heard

26:42.960 --> 26:44.560
- three drumbeats.
- My lady.

26:45.360 --> 26:46.600
- Then I saw…
- Wake up.

26:46.680 --> 26:48.520
My lady, wake up.

26:48.600 --> 26:50.560
- Hey.
- Who are you?

26:51.160 --> 26:52.200
My lady, I'm Lu Sheng.

26:52.280 --> 26:54.160
- I don't know you. Go away.
- What's wrong?

26:54.240 --> 26:56.040
- My lady, I'm Lu Sheng.
- Don't touch me!

26:56.120 --> 26:57.560
- Don't be scared.
- It's me.

26:57.640 --> 27:00.280
- I'm Lu Sheng.
- I don't know you.

27:00.360 --> 27:01.360
Don't touch me! Go away!

27:01.440 --> 27:03.080
- Don't be scared.
- Don't touch me!

27:10.000 --> 27:12.480
Why did you carry a weapon with you?

27:12.560 --> 27:15.280
The trip to the capital was long.

27:15.800 --> 27:19.000
I feared bandits,

27:19.080 --> 27:22.320
so I had one made.
I wore it under my dress.

27:22.400 --> 27:26.680
The skirt covered it. No one noticed.

27:27.480 --> 27:30.160
I meant to remove it before the wedding.

27:30.240 --> 27:33.520
But as an orphan with only one servant,

27:34.040 --> 27:36.360
I feared gossip about my character.

27:37.440 --> 27:40.680
Showing the dagger to my husband
would prove my purity.

27:41.560 --> 27:44.640
Who'd think it would cause this disaster?

27:48.400 --> 27:49.560
Haode.

27:50.080 --> 27:52.360
Is Lu Sheng dead yet?

27:53.800 --> 27:55.600
He's not dead,

27:56.120 --> 27:57.640
but not alive either.

27:58.160 --> 27:59.360
He's hanging by a thread.

28:00.120 --> 28:01.360
If he dies,

28:02.680 --> 28:04.040
won't I be buried with him?

28:04.640 --> 28:07.560
Haode, I was terrified.

28:07.640 --> 28:08.920
I didn't mean to kill him.

28:09.000 --> 28:11.240
I didn't mean it!

28:11.320 --> 28:13.040
Haode.

28:13.120 --> 28:14.440
- Please help me!
- Yuchan.

28:14.520 --> 28:16.640
- Haode.
- Yuchan, get up.

28:16.720 --> 28:17.880
- Haode.
- This won't do.

28:17.960 --> 28:20.960
- Please save my life, Haode.
- Get up.

28:21.040 --> 28:24.200
Now, the Lu family claims in unison

28:24.280 --> 28:26.160
that you planned to murder Lu Sheng.

28:26.880 --> 28:28.400
According to Song law,

28:28.480 --> 28:30.880
killing one's husband is a heinous crime.

28:31.680 --> 28:33.120
It's one of the ten great evils.

28:33.200 --> 28:35.840
I… I can't help you.

28:35.920 --> 28:37.360
A heinous crime…

28:40.280 --> 28:42.760
Yuchan! Yuchan!

29:00.560 --> 29:03.160
Brother, the Lu family deceived her first.

29:03.240 --> 29:06.240
This whole thing seems absurd.
I doubt it too.

29:06.840 --> 29:10.560
After investigating, we found Lu Sheng
was indeed injured by bandits.

29:11.160 --> 29:12.440
Merchant Wang Mu

29:12.520 --> 29:14.600
and Dr. Liu Zaichang can both testify.

29:14.680 --> 29:17.040
The fraud claim is baseless.

29:17.120 --> 29:19.000
But they did hide the truth.

29:19.080 --> 29:22.280
If Lu's family admitted it earlier,
what would you have done?

29:22.360 --> 29:23.680
Cancel the wedding.

29:23.760 --> 29:26.040
And if the Lu family refused?

29:26.120 --> 29:27.800
They'd take it to court in Kaifeng.

29:27.880 --> 29:29.480
Any betrothed woman who backs out

29:29.560 --> 29:32.000
would be punished with 60 lashes.

29:32.800 --> 29:36.240
Even if she's promised to another,
she must return to her original fiancé.

29:36.840 --> 29:38.040
Haode.

29:38.680 --> 29:40.200
The contract is no trivial matter.

29:40.280 --> 29:42.840
Canceling a wedding over appearance

29:42.920 --> 29:44.520
is no better

29:44.600 --> 29:47.480
than the Deng family's greed.

29:47.560 --> 29:48.840
Yuchan turned herself in,

29:48.920 --> 29:50.760
so her penalty should be reduced.

29:50.840 --> 29:54.280
But harming her husband
is excluded from leniency.

29:54.880 --> 29:56.960
She was terrified that night.

29:57.040 --> 29:59.880
It was understandable
to make such mistake.

30:00.480 --> 30:03.160
If the Lu family had been honest,
this wouldn't have happened.

30:03.240 --> 30:06.600
Lu Sheng is only injured.
Her crime doesn't warrant death.

30:06.680 --> 30:07.720
It's pointless.

30:07.800 --> 30:10.320
By law, her crime is punishable by death.

30:11.320 --> 30:12.480
My lord.

30:15.520 --> 30:18.400
Official Du and Commander Qiao are here.

30:18.480 --> 30:20.360
- Let them in.
- Sure.

30:21.560 --> 30:25.080
My lady, Leshan is looking for you.

30:26.160 --> 30:27.000
Got it.

30:33.000 --> 30:33.920
Haode.

30:43.600 --> 30:45.880
Is the court sentencing Yuchan to death?

30:45.960 --> 30:47.200
Shen told you this himself?

30:47.280 --> 30:50.920
Murdering her husband.
Is it beheading or cutting from the waist?

30:51.000 --> 30:53.400
Leshan, stop it.

30:53.480 --> 30:54.320
Why are you here?

30:54.400 --> 30:56.840
Haode, don't be mad.

30:56.920 --> 30:58.520
Everyone in Bianjing

30:58.600 --> 31:01.640
is watching this case. Even Mom is.

31:01.720 --> 31:04.240
I prepared Yuchan's dowry myself.

31:04.760 --> 31:06.920
Seeing her like this,

31:07.000 --> 31:08.720
I can't bear it.

31:08.800 --> 31:11.440
I keep thinking of a way to save her.

31:11.520 --> 31:14.760
Murdering her husband
on the wedding night.

31:14.840 --> 31:16.760
Even the gods can't save her now.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.840
Haode, why not ask her

31:20.920 --> 31:22.600
if she has any last wishes?

31:22.680 --> 31:25.320
We can help her fulfill them
and ease her mind.

31:30.520 --> 31:32.960
Isn't that Cui from Yuchan's side?

31:33.640 --> 31:35.440
What's she sneaking around for?

31:36.440 --> 31:38.080
If Master's spirit is watching,

31:38.160 --> 31:39.920
please protect my young lady.

31:40.000 --> 31:42.400
Don't let her die alone

31:42.480 --> 31:44.400
as a wandering ghost.

31:44.480 --> 31:46.040
Don't let her

31:46.120 --> 31:48.560
end up without a burial place.

31:49.360 --> 31:51.560
Please. Please protect her.

31:53.000 --> 31:54.080
Cui.

31:58.680 --> 31:59.720
You wretched maid.

31:59.800 --> 32:02.520
Running off after seeing my sister.
What guilt are you hiding?

32:02.600 --> 32:05.400
How could I dare, living under your roof?

32:06.000 --> 32:08.520
I was just mourning for my young lady,

32:09.120 --> 32:10.400
alone and helpless,

32:10.480 --> 32:12.840
hoping for a place to stand in this world.

32:13.440 --> 32:16.080
I thought she'd found a good match.

32:16.680 --> 32:19.320
Who'd expect it to end like this?

32:19.400 --> 32:22.800
I just hate the heavens' unfairness.
All I could do was cry for her.

32:22.880 --> 32:25.640
She was rejected here and there.

32:25.720 --> 32:27.280
But she chose the Lu family herself.

32:27.360 --> 32:30.000
Your words are full of blame
for my sister.

32:30.760 --> 32:33.640
She helped prepare her marriage greatly.
Now, it's all her fault?

32:34.240 --> 32:36.880
What were you just burning?
Are you cursing my sister?

32:37.680 --> 32:41.280
I wouldn't dare! I was only…

32:41.360 --> 32:44.560
Praying for your lady's blessing?
Then, why hide it?

32:44.640 --> 32:46.200
Who were you mourning before I came?

32:46.960 --> 32:49.120
Murdering a husband is a death sentence.

32:49.200 --> 32:52.280
If you want Yuchan to live,
there's only one way.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.840
My lady, may I say?

32:57.000 --> 33:00.480
I've visited the Lu family
to check on Lu Sheng.

33:00.560 --> 33:02.880
He's still in a fevered coma.

33:03.480 --> 33:06.080
The Lu family is furious.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.880
They insist on sentencing her to death.

33:08.480 --> 33:09.800
That's troubling.

33:10.320 --> 33:13.720
If Lu Sheng survives,
Yuchan may have a chance.

33:13.800 --> 33:16.360
If not, she faces execution.

33:17.400 --> 33:18.920
- Qiao Du.
- My lord?

33:19.000 --> 33:22.560
Send men to watch over the Lu family.
Report immediately if he wakes.

33:22.640 --> 33:23.680
Understood.

33:24.720 --> 33:25.680
This can't wait.

33:25.760 --> 33:27.280
This case

33:27.360 --> 33:29.400
has the whole city's attention.

33:30.000 --> 33:32.600
The verdict should be out tomorrow,
so I came here for instructions.

33:33.280 --> 33:35.400
Should we sentence her to dismemberment?

33:37.600 --> 33:39.520
You're the presiding judge.

33:39.600 --> 33:41.640
Do it by the law. It's your call.

33:42.840 --> 33:44.080
No, no.

33:46.720 --> 33:47.800
Absolutely not!

33:49.080 --> 33:52.160
Haode, we're discussing the murder case.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.440
Don't act rash.

33:54.120 --> 33:55.240
Official Du,

33:55.320 --> 33:59.680
what's the punishment for marrying
during mourning?

33:59.760 --> 34:02.560
Children must observe mourning
for their parents.

34:02.640 --> 34:06.040
Marrying in mourning is disrespectful.

34:06.120 --> 34:07.920
It also violates state law.

34:08.520 --> 34:11.400
During mourning, marriages are annulled

34:11.480 --> 34:13.560
with a three-year sentence and a divorce.

34:13.640 --> 34:15.960
So, they can't remain husband and wife?

34:18.000 --> 34:20.560
She was engaged before her mourning ended?

34:20.640 --> 34:23.640
Not just engaged.

34:23.720 --> 34:26.720
Today is her last mourning day.

34:27.440 --> 34:30.320
I saw Cui sneaking off earlier,
burning offerings.

34:30.400 --> 34:33.040
I questioned her, and she admitted it.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.640
Turns out, they feared

34:35.720 --> 34:38.000
her stepmother's provocations.

34:38.080 --> 34:39.920
They lied about the mourning ending,

34:40.640 --> 34:42.520
rushed the marriage to escape.

34:42.600 --> 34:45.480
So, Fang stabbing Lu Sheng

34:45.560 --> 34:48.800
isn't a murder case. Also,
it can't be seen as a great evil.

34:54.840 --> 34:57.280
Murderers get a three-year sentence,

34:57.800 --> 34:59.360
but injurers face strangulation.

34:59.880 --> 35:01.440
She still can't escape death.

35:01.520 --> 35:03.440
Yuchan confessed

35:03.520 --> 35:05.720
immediately after arrest.

35:06.320 --> 35:07.640
The injury was to an outsider.

35:07.720 --> 35:09.760
Turning herself in reduces her sentence.

35:09.840 --> 35:12.000
Strangulation becomes exile.

35:12.080 --> 35:15.080
Under the law,

35:15.960 --> 35:19.920
exile spans 3,000 miles.
She can take 20 lashes instead.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.160
Plus--

35:21.240 --> 35:22.120
One year of labor.

35:27.280 --> 35:31.680
Fine, marrying in mourning
unexpectedly saved her life.

35:31.760 --> 35:35.000
What a twist of fate, life from death!

35:37.920 --> 35:40.880
But marrying during mourning
defies morality.

35:40.960 --> 35:43.680
Taking a life is even more heartless.

35:43.760 --> 35:46.840
Why would you go to such lengths
for someone like her?

35:47.440 --> 35:49.360
If she's good, I defend her.

35:49.440 --> 35:51.160
If she's bad, I still defend her.

35:51.760 --> 35:53.520
Because her crime doesn't warrant death.

35:54.640 --> 35:55.480
Haode,

35:55.560 --> 35:57.520
you've grown so impressive

35:57.600 --> 36:00.920
since marrying Lord Shen.

36:02.600 --> 36:06.360
Yuchan owes her life to you.
You saved her.

36:07.120 --> 36:10.640
Credit should go
to my fair brother-in-law.

36:12.200 --> 36:15.480
Qiao Du, send someone to Hangzhou

36:15.560 --> 36:18.240
to investigate the Fang family.

36:18.320 --> 36:20.280
- Write a full report.
- Yes.

36:20.360 --> 36:23.240
Brother, you're being overly cautious.

36:23.320 --> 36:25.600
Even if Yuchan was careless,

36:25.680 --> 36:26.760
she wouldn't forget

36:26.840 --> 36:28.960
her own father's mourning period.

36:29.640 --> 36:32.160
This is too serious. Cui wouldn't lie.

36:32.240 --> 36:34.960
Just a routine check. Go.

36:35.040 --> 36:36.840
Right away, my lord.

36:49.280 --> 36:51.320
- You?
- Since my brother-in-law is here,

36:51.400 --> 36:53.360
and we've discussed the case,

36:54.320 --> 36:55.920
let's move to the tea hall.

36:56.000 --> 36:59.280
I've got some Jianzhou white tea.

36:59.360 --> 37:02.840
It's the finest tea in the world.
I'd like to share it with you.

37:04.120 --> 37:06.800
Haode, your charm is something else.

37:06.880 --> 37:09.920
Lord Shen finishes court business,

37:10.000 --> 37:12.120
and then entertains guests?

37:14.400 --> 37:15.840
- Please.
- Please.

37:25.440 --> 37:27.520
SIFU HOUSE

37:30.120 --> 37:31.720
CLOSED FOR A DAY

37:33.080 --> 37:35.480
She married before mourning ended.

37:35.560 --> 37:37.280
So, it's not murder of her husband.

37:38.520 --> 37:42.440
Mom, you should've seen Haode today.

37:42.520 --> 37:45.120
She even outwitted Du.

37:45.840 --> 37:47.360
I don't think so.

37:47.440 --> 37:49.480
He's great at governance

37:49.560 --> 37:50.800
and cases.

37:50.880 --> 37:52.240
I think

37:52.320 --> 37:55.360
he's showing mercy to Yunchan,
letting her off.

37:55.440 --> 37:58.040
But you were the one who found the flaw.

37:58.120 --> 38:00.280
Without that, Yuchan was done for.

38:01.240 --> 38:04.120
Mom, don't you think I'm right?

38:04.960 --> 38:07.160
- Mom?
- Mom?

38:07.960 --> 38:10.000
Why are your eyes red?

38:13.840 --> 38:16.680
My Haode's grown up.

38:16.760 --> 38:18.440
You're so capable now.

38:18.960 --> 38:21.240
I barely recognize you.

38:21.320 --> 38:23.800
- Mom.
- I'm just happy for you.

38:25.360 --> 38:27.360
If I'd set this up myself,

38:27.880 --> 38:30.640
I could've made a fortune.

38:30.720 --> 38:32.320
Mom, what are you even saying?

38:34.000 --> 38:35.360
Come here. Give me a hug.

38:35.440 --> 38:36.440
Come here.

38:37.280 --> 38:38.720
Mom.

38:40.880 --> 38:44.560
I wish you'd all never grow up.

38:44.640 --> 38:48.920
Then you'd always stay by my side.

38:49.000 --> 38:51.040
But that's not how life works.

38:51.120 --> 38:53.480
One day, I'll grow too old

38:53.560 --> 38:56.080
to protect you.

38:56.600 --> 38:58.040
That's why

38:59.080 --> 39:00.720
you need to stand strong.

39:00.800 --> 39:04.560
Mother, once Yuchan's case ends,

39:04.640 --> 39:07.640
I'll move back home. I miss you so much.

39:07.720 --> 39:08.600
Alright, alright.

39:10.280 --> 39:11.960
Find someone for you sisters.

39:12.040 --> 39:13.760
They haven't found anyone suitable yet.

39:15.840 --> 39:18.280
My husband won't be easy to find.

39:18.360 --> 39:20.280
He must be smarter than Du.

39:20.360 --> 39:22.120
And funnier than Fan.

39:22.720 --> 39:25.320
Richer than Chai
and more respectful than Shen.

39:26.320 --> 39:28.440
- Right?
- Why are you scoffing?

39:28.520 --> 39:29.400
Nonsense.

39:29.480 --> 39:31.920
Find someone devoted to you.

39:32.000 --> 39:33.800
- Someone who'll cherish only you.
- Sure.

39:36.000 --> 39:37.160
Haode,

39:38.440 --> 39:41.200
you're here. It's chaos outside right now.

39:41.280 --> 39:43.320
- What happened?
- The marketplace is buzzing.

39:43.400 --> 39:44.640
Many are discussing the case.

39:44.720 --> 39:46.160
Lord Shen is impeached.

39:46.240 --> 39:48.760
Officers from the Censorate claim
he favors family in court.

39:52.480 --> 39:53.920
What's going on?

39:54.000 --> 39:56.400
All higher courts
insist she violated the law.

39:56.480 --> 40:00.200
And they know she's in a mourning period,
yet they still charged her with murder.

40:00.280 --> 40:04.040
They're insisting on a death sentence.
It's completely unjust.

40:04.120 --> 40:06.360
That's absurd.

40:07.400 --> 40:11.560
Dali Supreme Court argued,
even if this broke tradition,

40:11.640 --> 40:14.040
she's an orphan, poor and helpless.

40:14.120 --> 40:15.440
For survival,

40:15.520 --> 40:17.160
marrying in mourning isn't rare.

40:17.240 --> 40:20.240
Officials have often shown leniency.

40:21.320 --> 40:23.960
Their families followed tradition.

40:24.040 --> 40:26.080
But without legal resolution,

40:26.160 --> 40:27.920
their marriage isn't officially annulled.

40:28.000 --> 40:29.320
So, they're still a couple.

40:29.920 --> 40:32.760
Breaking the law for sentiment?

40:34.240 --> 40:37.120
If they cared about humanity,
why sentence her to death?

40:39.000 --> 40:42.280
My lord, the palace has summoned you.

40:43.240 --> 40:45.400
The officials
must've brought this case forward.

40:46.000 --> 40:48.400
I handled the case,
but they're blaming you.

40:49.000 --> 40:51.680
They're accusing you of favoritism.

40:51.760 --> 40:54.600
They want to use this case
to stir trouble.

40:56.440 --> 40:58.240
I'll go with you to explain.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.720
I oversee Kaifeng Court.

41:01.800 --> 41:03.200
Even if you judged this case,

41:03.280 --> 41:05.280
you can't report it without my approval.

41:06.320 --> 41:08.640
The palace summoned me. I'll go alone.

41:11.760 --> 41:14.440
How will you argue alone against others?

41:18.160 --> 41:19.560
Trust me.

41:28.400 --> 41:31.160
My lady, you should advise him

41:31.680 --> 41:34.040
to accept the death sentence and end this.

41:34.960 --> 41:36.280
A life hangs in the balance.

41:36.360 --> 41:39.200
How can we change the verdict out of fear?

41:39.720 --> 41:40.640
He won't agree to it.

41:40.720 --> 41:43.240
The lord has always been fair and just.

41:43.320 --> 41:45.320
He's offended many powerful officials.

41:45.840 --> 41:48.200
He'll become a target for this case.

42:00.360 --> 42:01.960
Will they sentence her to death?

42:02.800 --> 42:05.640
Some officials believe
she doesn't deserve it.

42:06.240 --> 42:08.640
But public opinion drowns them out.

42:08.720 --> 42:09.760
I fear Yuchan

42:11.080 --> 42:12.120
may not escape.

42:13.240 --> 42:15.960
My husband said
mobs are surrounding the court.

42:16.040 --> 42:19.240
They demand the sentence
be changed to death. Ridiculous.

42:20.080 --> 42:23.000
His Majesty has ordered a joint trial.

42:23.080 --> 42:25.800
But most officials support
the death sentence.

42:26.400 --> 42:27.720
Even the two lords

42:27.800 --> 42:30.280
could be implicated.

42:30.360 --> 42:31.720
I came today

42:32.520 --> 42:35.040
to ask for your help.
Convince Lord Du to reconsider.

42:35.120 --> 42:38.280
If we act now,
it'll be seen as justice served.

42:38.360 --> 42:40.320
Any later, it might be too late.

42:40.400 --> 42:43.000
I don't interfere with his work.

42:43.080 --> 42:46.480
He's stubborn by nature.
Advice won't sway him.

42:47.880 --> 42:50.480
I told you this trip was pointless.

42:51.480 --> 42:55.080
Shouhua would never ask him to change.

42:56.680 --> 43:00.160
Kangning, you're the one with ideas.
The priority now is saving her.

43:00.760 --> 43:01.840
Shouhua,

43:01.920 --> 43:04.880
your calmness is surprising.
It's about his officialdom.

43:04.960 --> 43:06.880
You don't want him to be punished, right?

43:07.480 --> 43:09.520
It's not that I won't. It's that I can't.

43:10.640 --> 43:13.720
Unless someone can turn the tide,

43:13.800 --> 43:15.120
there's nothing I can do.

43:21.040 --> 43:23.000
Do you have a plan, Mr. Qiao?

43:23.600 --> 43:24.560
Why not just say it?

43:25.320 --> 43:27.200
This shouldn't be done recklessly.

43:27.280 --> 43:29.000
But the lord's been like a brother to me.

43:29.600 --> 43:32.320
I can't stand by
while he refuses to change it.

43:32.400 --> 43:35.640
The storm is here, and there's no escape.

43:36.240 --> 43:37.960
If we want to get rid of it…

43:39.000 --> 43:41.240
- Unless…
- Unless what?

43:41.320 --> 43:44.720
Unless we remove the root of this mess.
Forget it.

43:44.800 --> 43:46.640
Pretend I never came.

43:47.880 --> 43:49.720
Unless Fang Yuchan dies immediately,

43:49.800 --> 43:53.000
the case ends for good. Is that right?

43:54.600 --> 43:55.760
What are you saying?

44:19.640 --> 44:21.200
LIU'S PHARMACY

44:24.600 --> 44:27.720
Haode, this is risky.

44:27.800 --> 44:30.960
If it goes wrong, we all go down.

44:31.040 --> 44:34.040
Shouldn't we talk to Shen first?

44:34.760 --> 44:35.800
Would he agree?

44:38.360 --> 44:40.760
Enough. I've made my decision.

44:41.840 --> 44:43.000
Don't talk me out of it.

45:34.280 --> 45:35.200
Thank you, my lady.

45:37.680 --> 45:40.400
This isn't the only trouble I'll handle.

45:47.720 --> 45:51.160
Shouhua said
her husband takes on everything.

45:51.760 --> 45:53.320
I think you're the same.

45:53.400 --> 45:55.800
You promised not to hide things from me.

45:55.880 --> 45:58.320
But when things happen, here we are again.

46:00.920 --> 46:02.400
Haode.

46:02.480 --> 46:04.920
I just didn't want to worry you.

46:05.640 --> 46:07.760
You were ready to send me away before.

46:08.280 --> 46:10.880
Now, it seems you can't be without me.

46:14.280 --> 46:15.520
Brother,

46:16.360 --> 46:19.200
I'll help you, even without being asked.

46:20.000 --> 46:22.360
Thank you, my lady.

46:24.200 --> 46:25.040
Write it down.

46:26.600 --> 46:28.000
Tonight

46:28.520 --> 46:30.520
will not be easy.

46:31.760 --> 46:35.400
Dr. Liu, when will my son wake up?

46:36.960 --> 46:39.840
His injuries are severe. He's very weak.

46:39.920 --> 46:41.840
I've changed his prescription. Let's wait.

46:50.920 --> 46:51.880
Lord Xue,

46:51.960 --> 46:55.400
I could never commit such an evil act.

46:55.480 --> 46:58.800
Please, spare my life.

46:59.320 --> 47:02.760
People only know Dr. Liu's fame.

47:02.840 --> 47:06.960
But they don't know
you sell faulty medicine.

47:07.040 --> 47:09.200
How many lives has it taken?

47:11.080 --> 47:12.880
Lord Xue!

47:12.960 --> 47:14.640
I… I…

47:40.040 --> 47:41.120
What's going on?

47:46.160 --> 47:47.320
Help!

47:47.400 --> 47:50.240
Someone help! The prisoner is ill.

47:50.320 --> 47:51.160
Someone help!

47:56.360 --> 47:57.800
Stop right there.

48:00.200 --> 48:01.840
The Supreme Court's reviewed the case

48:01.920 --> 48:04.680
under His Majesty's order.

48:05.200 --> 48:07.800
I'm about to question the key suspect.

48:08.520 --> 48:11.280
Where are you taking her?

48:12.800 --> 48:15.080
Lord Xue, the prisoner fell suddenly ill.

48:15.160 --> 48:17.400
She had chills, fever, and then delusions.

48:17.480 --> 48:20.640
With this summer heat,
malaria spreads fast.

48:20.720 --> 48:22.760
To prevent an outbreak,

48:22.840 --> 48:25.040
we'll isolate her.
I've reported to Lord Shen.

48:25.120 --> 48:28.120
She's ready to be sent to the infirmary

48:28.200 --> 48:29.600
to control the spread of disease.

48:29.680 --> 48:30.600
Malaria?

48:31.320 --> 48:33.360
This is clearly an attempt
to free the prisoner.

48:34.440 --> 48:36.800
- Arrest them all!
- Yes, my lord.

51:05.120 --> 51:07.720
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
